I'm probably at least partly wrong, but:
1) Just cuz you hear the hissing doesn't mean you're getting stoned.  It's
just a bit of color to get your adrenaline running.  Don't waste your
prayer until you get the "You feel yourself slowing down..." message.  I
don't know if one can ever be beloved enough of one's god to successfully
pray twice within one fight.  (Anyone know?)

2) You can limber up by eating 

- a lizard corpse (not just a : but an actual lizard corpse - they don't
  spoil, carry one around if you can deal with the weight)

- anything (i think) acidic - certainly acid blob corpses, and maybe ochre
  jelly corpses (again, anyone know for sure?)

The only catch is I don't know if there's a 100% chance of limbering up by
eating stuff - and it's also bad if you're satiated, alas.

Is there some sort of anti-stone intrinsic?  If not, should there be?

